# The root .gitignore excludes dist/ everywhere, because dist/ is normally build
# output. Here it is the deliverable: this directory is a build-once-commit vendored
# package, and the service's Dockerfile installs it with `npm ci`, which cannot
# rebuild it. Without this negation the vendored build is silently absent from the
# repo and the image only builds on a machine that happens to have it on disk.
!dist/
!dist/**
